<span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.993em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6713em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=0.125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span></span></span></span></span>，相对纯稠密的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>blk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\cdot S\\cdot F_\\text{blk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，比值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.125</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.56</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1+0.125)/2 \\approx 0.56</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.56</span></span></span></span></span>，即块部分省下约 44% 的 FLOP。注意力部分省得更多，因为被丢弃的 token 既不作为 query 也减少了参与的序列长度。这正是论文报告「每步训练快约 66%」的来源——省下的 FLOP 在 isoFLOP 预算下被换成更多步或更大模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>容量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>每块处理 token 比例</th>\n<th>相对 FLOP（每隔层 MoD）</th>\n<th>质量趋势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>1.00（退化为稠密）</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>约 0.75</td>\n<td>接近基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>约 0.63</td>\n<td>略降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.125</td>\n<td>12.5%</td>\n<td>约 0.56</td>\n<td>论文主设置，匹配基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.0625</td>\n<td>6.25%</td>\n<td>约 0.53</td>\n<td>开始明显掉点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"容量为什么不能随输入浮动\">容量为什么不能随输入浮动</h2><p>一个诱人的想法是让容量随输入难度浮动——难句子多放点 token 进块，易句子少放点。MoD 明确拒绝了这条路，因为浮动容量会立刻把静态图打回动态图，前辈们的批处理噩梦就回来了。MoD 的哲学是把「自适应」全部压进「选谁」这一维，而把「选几个」彻底固定，用一点点灵活性（不能按句子调总预算）换回巨大的工程红利（静态图、可批处理、可编译）。</p>\n<p>如果确实需要让总预算随场景变化，正确的做法是在不同的训练/部署配置里设不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，而不是在单次前向里浮动——容量是一个超参，不是一个运行时变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量与批处理的张力\">容量与批处理的张力</h2><p>容量是按单条序列定义的（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=cS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>）。在真实推理里，一个 batch 里不同序列长度不同，于是各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 不同，又会破坏 batch 内的张量对齐。工程上的解法（padding 到统一容量、或按长度分桶）属于推理实现的范畴，这里只点明这层张力存在，细节见 <a href=\"../practice/mod-inference\">推理实现</a>。这也是为什么容量虽然让单序列变成静态图，却没有让整个推理变简单——它把复杂度从「层内动态」搬到了「batch 对齐」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=\\lceil c\\cdot S\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 是编译期常数，论文主设置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=0.125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span></span></span></span></span>（每块只放 12.5% token）。</li>\n<li>固定容量让块的输入张量形状固定，把动态选择重新约束成静态计算图，这是 MoD 相对动态计算前辈的根本工程优势。</li>\n<li>FLOP 账：每隔层放 MoD、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=0.125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span></span></span></span></span> 时块开销约降到稠密的 0.56，注意力降得更多，这是「每步快约 66%」的来源。</li>\n<li>容量刻意不随输入浮动——把自适应压进「选谁」、把「选几个」固定，用一点灵活性换静态图红利；浮动需求靠改超参 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 而非运行时变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"token-routing\">token 路由</a> —— top-k 里「选谁」的打分逻辑。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"layer-skipping\">跳层机制</a> —— 为何每隔一层放 MoD。</li>\n<li>本库：<a href=\"../practice/mod-inference\">推理实现</a> —— 容量与 batch 对齐的工程解法。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../mixture-of-experts/training/load-balancing\">混合专家：负载均衡</a> —— MoE 容量因子与 MoD 容量的对照。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容量预算","id":"容量预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：容量因子与静态形状","id":"核心概念-容量因子与静态形状"},{"level":2,"text":"FLOP 账：省下来的到底是什么","id":"flop-账-省下来的到底是什么"},{"level":2,"text":"容量为什么不能随输入浮动","id":"容量为什么不能随输入浮动"},{"level":2,"text":"容量与批处理的张力","id":"容量与批处理的张力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"token 路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/mechanism/token-routing"},"next":{"title":"跳层机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/mechanism/layer-skipping"}}